OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome early bright spells, but
OL,6,Fcloud will feed across the region from
OL,7,Fthe northwest on Thursday morning,
OL,8,Fwith the small chance of a shower
OL,9,Fdeveloping heading into the afternoon.
OL,10,FPerhaps a heavier shower developing in
OL,11,Fthe north during the evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers will ease during
OL,14,Fthe course of the evening, leaving a
OL,15,Fmostly night to come with clear
OL,16,Fspells. Feeling rather cool, though
OL,17,Fmore comfortable compared to recent
OL,18,Fnights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
